abstract: >-
  An approval-first, evidence-bound AI coding harness purpose-built for Google Antigravity, Claude Code, and AI coding agents
  on Gradle Android and KMM/KMP (Kotlin Multiplatform Mobile) projects with AST/symbol graph
  discovery across Kotlin, Java, XML, and Swift, 6-tier dynamic risk routing, independent
  multi-agent code review, and deterministic verification gates.
